{"id":"vod_hh_88909","vodId":"88909","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"高智能方程式赛车 新世紀GPX","name_cn":"高智能方程式赛车 新世紀GPX","date":"1991-01-01","year":"1991","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第37集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/0adbfc15ded7e9d183c206ecf5681b15.jpg"},"summary":"2015年，配以电脑为导航系统的赛车比赛-Cyber Formula，取代了F1（一级方程式）成为21世纪世界最高水平的赛车赛事。14岁的少年风见隼人在护送父亲生前设计的赛车“阿斯拉”（ASURADA）到日本富士冈赛车场途中受到不知名的攻击，危急之下被迫驾驶“阿斯拉”，却因此被系统记录为唯一赛车手，不得不与职业赛车手新条直辉、布里德•加贺、卡尔•里婿特•冯•兰德尔等人一起角逐新世纪的赛车冠军。一站站的赛车比赛，不仅有赛车手之间的竞争，更有与青梅竹马菅生明日香之间的羁绊，风见隼人从此展开了新世纪GPX史上最年轻的冠军传说。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-28 10:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":31,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Qe1R5Zoa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdR9WA0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Le3W7A4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mbkEzvYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/NbW42G4d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/wdL4Nojd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/6dB4z5Wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/zbqNJ1Rd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9avVOAMa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/negzv3Zd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QbYg48Oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Qe1R5RGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdR9W9Yb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7axXQ3za/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第21集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/oeE4Djmd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第22集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kazZ0k5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第23集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mbkEz1re/inde